# Public repository: allowlist.
#
# Everything at the top level is ignored unless it is listed below, so a new
# file is private until someone deliberately adds it here. The surrounding
# directory also holds private working files (plans, agent definitions) that
# must never be committed.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.github/
!/Cargo.toml
!/Cargo.lock
!/README.md
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
!/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
!/SECURITY.md
!/LICENSE-APACHE
!/LICENSE-MIT
!/crates/
!/docs/

# Never commit these anywhere in the tree, including inside crates/ (tests
# run with a crate directory as their working directory).
target/
core
core.[0-9]*
vgcore.*
*.core
callgrind.out.*
cachegrind.out.*
massif.out.*
dhat*.json
perf.data*
*.profraw
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
